  SYSTEMATIC REVIEW TITLE/ABSTRACT SCREENING RESULTS                                                                    
  Review: Effects of total fat intake on body weight                                                                    
  Chunk: Studies 301-400 (100 studies total)                                                                            
                                                                                                                        
  SELECTION CRITERIA APPLIED:                                                                                           
  - Randomised intervention trial OR cohort study                                                                       
  - Included children (aged ≥ 24 months), young people or adults                                                        
